<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlīvum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlīvom</span></b> , i,
			n.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Oil</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-class. prose for oleum): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eme die caecā hercle olivum, id
					vendito oculatā die,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 1, 3, 67</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. As. 2, 4, 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ps. 1,
				2, 76</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2, 392</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. 6,
			1073</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inolens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					850</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pingue,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 5, 68</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 10, 176</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perfundere pisces olivo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 4, 50</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si ex olivis meis olivum feceris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, 79</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>the
				palœstra</i> (from the use of oil to anoint
			wrestlers): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cur olivum vitat?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 8, 8</span></i>
			; cf. oleum.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>an ointment</i>,
				<i>unguent</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Syrio fragrans olivo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
				6</span></i>
			. 8; <i><span class="en">Prop. 4, 16, 31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
